                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    langAttribute="none"
                                    text="&lt;p>AbbVie combines the experience of over 135 years of research &amp;amp; development and patient care with the dynamism and spirit of a young company, which we still uphold, even after more than 12 years. AbbVie was created in 2013 as a spin-off from Abbott.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>We offer our employees in Switzerland the framework conditions and development opportunities of a major global corporation, but in a family atmosphere, with around 280 employees in 2026.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                                <separator
                                    cq:styleIds="[1662756486159]"
                                    jcr:created="{Date}2026-05-28T13:50:16.132-04:00"
                                    jcr:createdBy="VALENSX5"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-05-28T13:50:16.132-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="VALENSX5"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/separator/v2/separator"/>
                                <title2_copy
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1651545824678,1651545825692]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-05-28T14:01:37.973-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="VALENSX5"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    jcr:title="What inspires us"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                    langAttribute="none"
                                    type="h3"
                                    variant="h"/>
                                <text2_copy
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1659545835858]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-05-28T14:03:08.405-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="VALENSX5"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    langAttribute="none"
                                    text="&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Innovative medicines and solutions that improve patients’ lives&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>A strong and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.com/science/pipeline.html&quot;>diverse pipeline&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>A culture characterized by trust, teamwork and active inclusion&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Competitive benefits and programs that support the needs of employees&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Flexible working hours, option of home office and sabbatical&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;(every five years)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Up to 30 days holiday, plus 6 additional days off as bridging days&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Individual development plans, leadership &amp;amp; management programs, etc.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Share ownership program for employees&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>Employee assistance programs&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>And much more...&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>87% employee satisfaction rate in this year’s survey speaks for itself.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                                <separator_copy_copy_
                                    cq:styleIds="[1662756486159]"
                                    jcr:created="{Date}2026-05-28T13:50:16.132-04:00"
                                    jcr:createdBy="VALENSX5"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-05-28T13:50:16.132-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="VALENSX5"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/separator/v2/separator"/>
                                <title2_copy_copy_cop_1918714139
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1651545824678,1651545825692]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-05-28T14:04:24.628-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="VALENSX5"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    jcr:title="Passion is Fuel of Innovation "
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                    langAttribute="none"
                                    type="h3"
                                    variant="h"/>
                                <text2_copy_copy_copy_1301691577
                                    cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1659545835858]"
                                    jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-05-28T14:04:32.984-04:00"
                                    jcr:lastModifiedBy="VALENSX5"
                                    jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                    sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                    langAttribute="none"
                                    text="&lt;p>Passion drives us to transcend our limitations and aim for the stars, just as we do every day in our commitment to serving patients in the best possible way.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>An example of different roles demonstrates how each of us contributes to making a difference in patients’ lives. In just 15 seconds, 12 employees demonstrated how their work is a personal contribution to our mission to leave no eligible patient behind. Visit our video gallery to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.ch/en/join-us/life-at-abbvie/meet-our-employees-in-15-seconds.html&quot;>meet our employees in 15 seconds&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
                                <separator_copy_copy__1239523956
                                    cq:styleIds="[1662756486159]"
                                    jcr:created="{Date}2026-05-28T13:50:16.132-04:00"
